BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Urban Retreat 2026
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260912T143000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260912T213000
UID:f4cb3de513349701183c6aba@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:How much can we change our mind in one week? The Urban Retreat
  is a chance to find out. For seven days\, the LBC's usual programme becom
 es something altogether more intensive – a series of special events desi
 gned to create the immersive\, transformative conditions of a retreat with
 out leaving the city. All are welcome\, sign up for free on our website.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/urban-retreat-2026
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Opening Ceremony | In person
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260912T143000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260912T170000
UID:dae08ec7db7252298d3bad90@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:Meet the team and your fellow retreatants and commit to turnin
 g your life into a retreat over the coming week. We'll look at how to best
  engage with the retreat\, reflect on our intentions and hopes\, and take 
 part in a special opening ceremony to start the retreat together.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/urban-retreat-kick-off-2
 026
END:VEVENT
