DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260912T143000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260912T153000
UID:c090cd79c12f5d0c83e13ed8@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:For those joining the Urban Retreat online. Join us for the op
 ening ceremony of the Urban Retreat 2026 from wherever you are — setting
  intentions and beginning the week together.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/urban-retreat-2026-onlin
 e-opening-ceremony
